 "remarks": "Desirable Cove Location ! 6 Family Apartment Building  3 Floors. Well maintained property. All apartments are 4 rooms in a railroad configuration. 2 apartments per floor. All 6 apartments are separately metered gas and electric. All tenants are responsible for their heat, hot water and electric. Secure storage room in basement for each tenant. Each apartment is separately metered for electric and gas heat and hot water. 6 Boilers and hot water heaters are newly replaced in the last 7 years. Updated electric meters and fuse panels. Building has sprinkle system in basement and remote controlled smoke and carbon monoxide thru out. As per fire department approval. Off street Parking for approximately 10 cars. Walk to Cove beach. Bus stop across the street. Great property Easy to manage. SEE EXPENSE AND INCOME STATEMENT IN THE DOCUMENT SECTION .",
